    "created_at": "2025-03-03T15:20:24Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-03-03T15:20:24Z",
    "body": "It's a little inconsistent in that for ordinary form submission the `button` element would have its value included regardless if it's the submitter.\n\nMaybe we should separately define \"command value\" and use that where appropriate?",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
